Tuti [Em] sbse yaari,        Me toh [Bm] zindagi se haari
Gyi [Am] saaso ko dukhaake,        Kha pe yeh haw [Bm] waa
Kyun rabba is [Em] kadar todeya ve,        Ke ek tuk [C] daa na chodeyaa [D]
Dhadakane ke [Em] lie dhadkano me,        Kuchna [C] bachaa [D]
[Em] Khudka wajudd kho gya,        [C] Saaya bhi peraaya ho gya
[Am] Dekhaa hai tjhko khi pey,        [Em] Bole mera ayina
[Em] Khudko naa pehchaanoo,        Pta [Bm] na khudka naa jaanu
Jau abb [Am] me kha pey,        Dikhey na raas [Bm] ata
