Dhadakane ke [Em] liye dhadkano me,        Kuch na [C] bachha [D]
[Em] Dil ka naseeb tha buraa,        Jo [C] sochha tha woh naa hua
[Am] Durr se jo lga samander,        [Bm] Tha wo manzar rait ka
[Em] Dilka naseeb tha bura,        Jo [C] socha tha woh na hua
[Am] Durr se jo laga samandr,        [Bm] Tha woh manzar ret ka
Dhoka [Em] de gyi takdeere,        Jhutti [Bm] nikli laqeerey
